{
  "slug": "chub",
  "name": "Chub",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Fetches curated, versioned API docs from Context Hub before writing code — so Claude uses current APIs instead of hallucinating from training data. Auto-installs via npx (no global setup), refreshes the doc registry each session, and supports search, annotations, and feedback. Works with 1500+ documented libraries including OpenAI, Stripe, Anthropic, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `get-api-docs` (Use this skill when you need documentation for a third-party library, SDK, or API before writing code that…) and **1 hook**, `SessionStart`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install chub@claude-community` from `naga-k/chub-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
